      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Dan was fantastic and so patient. When he came out to do the quote he had software on his laptop that let us go through so many different scenarios to find the exact right system for me and my energy usage. The installation was quick, and the guys were ridiculously thorough and clean (they even swept my garage at the end of day 1 so I could park in there overnight). There were a few things that came up after the system was installed (very glad I got the emberpulse they recommended as I wouldn't have noticed these problems otherwise!), but Dan was quick to get back out here and fix them up. Overall very happy with the service provided and even happier with the amount of solar i've been producing, even in winter!",
