      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Usually I am not the sort of person to take the time to put in a review. However in this case I could not. Frank and his team are Advanced All Energy in Adelaide are absolute super stars of Solar. Dan Lawes did the site assessment and quotation and was superb in every aspect. Really knows electrical and solar and how to get the best for your house.Chewy and Nathan did the install as sub contractors and walked us through every step of what was a challenging install on a 1880â€™s Villa. They too superb care of the house and nothing was too much trouble. They really treat the install as if it was their own house.Frank understands the power of meeting customers needs and a real gentleman in all aspects of doing business. He knows word of mouth is worth more than just getting in doing a cheap, slap dash job.Given the many cheap offers out there and dodgy cold call Solar operators, I would STRONGLY recommend the professionals at Advanced All Energy to everyone who wants what they pay for, a quality product that matches your exact budget and solar needs. Awesome job!",
